{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/Steam_descriptionGIFS_2025_multiplayer.gif?t=1747330324\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Engage in asynchronous T<u>urn-Based Strategy</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate and evolve unique mushroom species. Compete for dominance across many worlds,\u00a0 each with a dynamic ecosystem of wind, events and climate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/Steam_descriptionGIFS_2025_Worlds.gif?t=1747330324\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer and solo modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge Friends or the CPU; whomever lands <strong>Spores</strong> nearby, thoughtful turn mechanics will provide surprise and discovery on every turn as you cohabitate the living environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Show off your favorite spores with funky cosmetics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and swap Skins, Caps, and Staves! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/Steam_descriptionGIFS_2025_Customizations.gif?t=1747330324\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build customizations and unlocks</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each playable <strong>Spore</strong> has secrets to unlock on your quest to thrive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your match earnings in the skill tree to access new Blooms and playstyles, trait abilities, lab definitions and cosmetics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Procedurally generated maps for varied gameplay</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maps utilize procedural generation to foster innovative puzzle-like challenges, including varied shapes, resources, special tiles, and dynamic events. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop extensive underground networks or concentrate on efficient mushroom cultivation and abilities!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Inspired by real-world mycology and ecosystems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed by <strong>solo indie developer</strong> and <strong>mycology enthusiast</strong> Jake Collinge, the mechanics are<strong>\u00a0</strong>inspired by real mushroom ecology: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat detritus \u2018waste\u2019 material </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parasitize opponent mushrooms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow above and below ground </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form mutual relationships to earn Nitrogen </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek out humus and other resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">React to the environment: wind direction, humidity and soil quality </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your underground territory </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cut off opponent resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026and much more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diverse mushroom species with unique abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SporeBloom: Mycelium Master</strong> will continue to expand post release, introducing new  playable <strong>Spores</strong>, mushrooms, traits, abilities, maps and cosmetics, flexing the immense variety of techniques real mushrooms use to survive</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2895740?t=1747330324","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/a137b6452895abebbc1489d5f46dabf03618e89c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747330324","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/